          <attvalue for="3" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="I'll help you find the top-rated yoga studio in San Francisco.&#10;&#10;Thought: To find the top-rated yoga studio in San Francisco, I need to search for this information on the web. I'll use the web_search tool to get search results about top-rated yoga studios in SF.&#10;&#10;Code:&#10;```py&#10;search_results = web_search(&quot;top rated yoga studio in San Francisco&quot;)&#10;print(search_results)&#10;```&lt;end_code&gt;" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="Execution logs:&#10;## Search Results&#10;&#10;[3 Best Yoga Studios in San Francisco, CA - Expert Recommendations](https://threebestrated.com/yoga-studios-in-san-francisco-ca)&#10;&quot; The Pad Studios is a women-owned and operated yoga studio with a rich history spanning over 15 years in the community. The studio is nestled in the lively Marina/Cow-Hollow District of San Francisco. Over time, it has evolved into a trusted haven for yoga enthusiasts seeking a fulfilling practice.&#10;&#10;[10 of the Best Yoga &amp; Pilates Studios in San Francisco - Travel Magazine](https://www.travelmag.com/articles/yoga-pilates-studios-san-francisco/)&#10;This locally-owned yoga center has opened studios in seven districts of San Francisco. Merging with the former Yoga Garden studio has enabled Moxie to offer classes in one of the city's most iconic yoga locations in lower Divisadero: a blue-panelled, three-storey Victorian house with spacious, light-filled practice rooms - leave time to explore the area's vibrant shops and cafés while ...&#10;&#10;[THE BEST 10 Yoga in SAN FRANCISCO, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/search?cflt=yoga&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA)&#10;Best Yoga in San Francisco, CA - The Center SF, Folk, Yoga Flow SF - Ocean, Body Temp Yoga, Yoga Flow SF - Union St, Thriveability Yoga, Lotusland Yoga SF, Integral Yoga Institute, The Castro Room, Ritual Hot Yoga - Soma&#10;&#10;[TOP 10 BEST Yoga Studios in San Francisco, CA - Yelp](https://www.yelp.com/search?find_desc=yoga+studios&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA)&#10;Top 10 Best Yoga Studios near you in San Francisco, CA - December 2024 - Yelp - Yoga Flow SF - Ocean, Folk, The Yoga Shala, Funky Door Yoga, yogabeach, Body Temp Yoga, Haum, Yoga Flow SF - Union St, Love Story Yoga, Purusha Yoga Studio ... Top 10 Best yoga studios Near San Francisco, California. Sort: Recommended. All.&#10;&#10;[The best yoga studios in san Francisco - Time Out](https://www.timeout.com/san-francisco/t