          <attvalue for="0" value="action" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="Thought: Based on the search results, I need to analyze the information to determine which yoga studio in San Francisco is considered the top-rated. I see mentions of several studios including The Pad Studios, Yoga Flow SF, Folk, The Center SF, and others. Let me visit some of the review sites like Yelp to get more specific information about the highest-rated studio.&#10;&#10;Code:&#10;```py&#10;yelp_url = &quot;https://www.yelp.com/search?cflt=yoga&amp;find_loc=San+Francisco,+CA&quot;&#10;yelp_page = visit_webpage(yelp_url)&#10;print(yelp_page)&#10;```&lt;end_code&gt;" />
